<title>USA: Gray Communications board approves buyback.</title>
<headline>Gray Communications board approves buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, Ga. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc said Thursday it approved the repurchase of up to one million shares of the company's Class B common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the purchased shares will be retired or reissued in connection with the company's benefit plans, including the company's stock option, restricted stock and performance award plans.</p>
<p>The company also said it approved the purchase and retirement of up to $10.0 million of its senior subordinated notes.</p>
<p>Gray Communications Systems Inc operates two NBC affiliated television stations.</p>
</text>
